OL,3,GNEWSAWhy did people want to see a
OL,4,Apolice commissioner on stage?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #79,000 a year police commissioner
OL,7,Fhas been under fire for plans to carry
OL,8,Fout a 127-date stage show tour.
OL,10,FOpposition parties questioned how
OL,11,FReform UK's Colin Sutton, could focus
OL,12,Fon his job overseeing Norfolk
OL,13,FConstabulary while travelling across
OL,14,Fthe UK.
OL,16,FEventually, Sutton dropped out of the
OL,17,F"ridiculous" theatre run following a
OL,18,Fbacklash.
